{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 31, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "\"Oh, darling, you look… comfortable,\" Seraphina said, swirling in her emerald green ball gown. The fabric shimmered under the dim hallway light.\n\nAcross from her, Leo tugged at the waistband of his sweatpants. He had a faded band t-shirt and a worn hoodie. \"And you look like you're about to float away. Ready for the annual Starlight Soiree?\"\n\n\"Absolutely! It's tradition, Leo. Besides,\" Seraphina adjusted a delicate lace sleeve, \"one must make an effort. It’s the Mayor’s birthday, after all.\"\n\nLeo sighed, running a hand through his messy hair. \"I know, I know. Just… not really my scene. All that… formality.\"\n\n\"Nonsense! It’s a chance to see everyone. And the hors d'oeuvres are always divine.\" Seraphina gave him a pointed look. \"Come on, don’t tell me you're going to hide in the corner with a plate of mini quiches again?\"\n\n\"Hey, those mini quiches are serious business! But seriously, I’m just not a fan of dressing up. It feels… fake.\"\n\n\"It's not fake! It's celebratory! Besides,\" Seraphina winked, \"it's always good for a bit of drama. Think of the stories we'll have to tell.\"\n\n\"I'd rather tell stories about the band I saw last night. No sequins required.\"\n\n*   \"I suppose we can agree to disagree on the sequin situation,\" Seraphina conceded, smoothing her skirt. \"Just try to have a little fun, alright? For me?\"\n\n\"Fine, fine. I'll try to be festive. But if I have to wear a bow tie, I'm staging a protest.\"\n\n*   \"Deal. No bow ties. But a smile would be appreciated.\" Seraphina gently took his arm. \"Now, let's go. The champagne awaits.\"\n\nLeo reluctantly followed, adjusting his hoodie. \"Just promise me you won't try to teach me the waltz.\"\n\n*   \"No promises,\" Seraphina said with a mischievous glint in her eye. \"But I’ll try to keep the spinning to a minimum.\"\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logpro